==History==
The history of Toyozawa is shaped by many conflicts it encountered. Being a primitive outpost for the Atsu people, it played a role with trade with the Miyagi empire inhabitants as well as foreigners. It later grew to a large settlement of around 2,300 before an attack by the primitive Miyagi citizens forced the Atsus to abandon the settlement and move further south into what is now Aomori prefecture.

